{"id":"n82048-1-7","stage":5,"title":"편안히 · 平安地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82048-1-7-1","ko":"이제 조금 있으면 무대에 올라가야 해. 너무 떨려.","zh":"再过一会儿我就得上台了。我紧张极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으면","audio":"/audio/909011195908a586359d.mp3"}},{"text":"무대에","meaning":"舞台","explanation":"무대：舞台；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"1","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무대에","audio":"/audio/ab0707e5bb6f653f2f80.mp3"}},{"text":"올라가야","meaning":"上，上去","explanation":"올라가다：上，上去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"1","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라가야","audio":"/audio/5c9d9e221ffa7a26b40d.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"떨려.","meaning":"发抖，颤动","explanation":"떨리다：发抖，颤动；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨리다","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69293","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨려","audio":"/audio/e457d93e49731ca0914d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"说话的当时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"64389d2db12c00f1","term":"무대","zh":"舞台","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3","entryId":"15524","definition":"为了表演戏剧、舞蹈、音乐等，在观众席前建造的高于观众席的宽大台子。","pronunciation":["무ː대"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，上去","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从下向上，从低处前往高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"cc04aaccec373561","term":"떨리다","zh":"发抖，颤动","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3","entryId":"69293","definition":"身体或身体的一部分反复快速地抖动。","pronunciation":["떨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/29fec612be8f3d20e8c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82048-1-7-2","ko":"숨을 크게 쉬고 마음을 편안히 가져.","zh":"深呼吸，放轻松吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"숨을","meaning":"呼吸","explanation":"숨：呼吸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숨","audio":"/audio/19b65768173f5897377a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62463","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숨을","audio":"/audio/27ab287b5261265f18d0.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","explanation":"크다：大，洪亮，嘹亮；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"6","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬고","meaning":"呼吸，喘","explanation":"쉬다：呼吸，喘；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62819","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬고","audio":"/audio/d0753afd68e19972026c.mp3"}},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음을","audio":"/audio/b0b3c273455e1de5d694.mp3"}},{"text":"편안히","meaning":"平安地，舒适地，安稳地","explanation":"편안히：平安地，舒适地，安稳地","readings":[{"term":"편안히","audio":"/audio/a0891c90668e6a506bd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82048","senseId":"1","lemma":"편안히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편안히","audio":"/audio/a0891c90668e6a506bd2.mp3"}},{"text":"가져.","meaning":"怀有，感","explanation":"가지다：怀有，感；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定